@phoenix-drake):

SCENE CONTEXT

@jungle-prince flies on 
@phoenix-drake through a colossal jungle of mile-high fantastical trees. Wordless throughout, he steers with his body and pure joy, laughing and whooping as 
@phoenix-drake pulls off daring tricks: a sheer near-vertical plunge down an immensely tall 90° waterfall almost grazing the water, a low skim across the pool, passing through a cloud of giant butterflies with a single breathtaking slow-motion moment, gliding between branches past leaping monkeys, threading a razor-narrow gap, then climbing straight up the trunks and bursting above the canopy into a vast reveal of the whole world. One continuous soaring flight.

ACTIVE REFERENCES
@phoenix-drake: 100% matches the reference, scarlet-crimson body with cobalt-blue and gold wing feathers, phoenix flame-tipped tail streamers, black obsidian horns, molten-amber eyes, identical every frame.
@jungle-prince: 100% matches the reference, same person throughout, same tousled dark bronze hair with braided feathers, bark-leather chest strap, kilt wrap, bronze arm cuff.

FIRST FRAME / BLOCKING
Non-empty opening frame: 
@phoenix-drake and 
@jungle-prince, seen from behind, already hanging high at the very top of the immensely tall 90° waterfall, already tipping nose-down into the vertical plunge with wings folding in, nothing is frozen.

FORMAT MODE
Single continuous take, 15s, 16:9 anamorphic. One in-camera speed ramp into super slow motion for a single butterfly close-up at 4-6s, then a hard snap back to real-time.

OPTICS
107° FOV, wide rectilinear, prime-lens character, camera locked 0.5-0.8m behind 
@phoenix-drake, 180° shutter motion blur, no drift.

CAMERA
Chase camera locked BEHIND for the entire clip, holds their backs in frame. During the slow-mo beat the camera keeps rear position and racks focus onto a butterfly at the lens. Wide tonal latitude, soft highlight roll-off.

ACTION
0-3s: vertical plunge down the 90° waterfall wings tucked, flare into a low water skim, wingtips slicing spray. 3-4s: rises into a swarm of giant luminous butterflies. 4-6s: super slow-motion butterfly close-up at the lens, iridescent wings beating slow, then sharp snap back to real-time. 6-9s: soars on locked wings between crossing branches, monkeys leap and turn to stare. 9-11.5s: folds wings and shoots through a razor-narrow vertical gap between two leaning trunks, corkscrew roll on the far side. 11.5-15s: pitches up and powers straight up the trunks with broad heaving wingbeats, bursts above the canopy into a colossal wide reveal of an endless sea of mile-high trees.

PHYSICS
Wings tucked in the plunge, wide and locked while gliding, broad and heaving on the climb. Real aerodynamic load on the flare. 
@jungle-prince's body braces and shifts with every move, hair and feathers snap with airspeed. Contact shadows and spray trails read on the water skim.

LIGHTING
Warm golden sun screen-right raking through volumetric god-rays, WB 5200K. Blazing saturation, emerald and jade midtones, cobalt water, warm gold accents, scarlet and crimson pops from 
@phoenix-drake. Sun rim-lights the wings and hair. Rainbow through waterfall spray. Cool cyan-shadow in the narrow gap, then bursts back to daylight.

COLOR GRADE
Blazing painterly jungle grade, emerald and jade midtones, turquoise water, warm gold god-rays, hot scarlet and orange from the drake and flowers. Color tied to source and surface, not a flat list.

AUDIO
NO MUSIC. SFX ONLY, diegetic throughout. Waterfall roar, rushing air in the dive, wing-flare thump, spray, soft flutter of butterflies, dreamy stretched sound in the slow-mo beat, hard snap back to full-speed wind, chittering monkeys, whoosh through the gap, broad wingbeats on the climb, 
@phoenix-drake's soft chirps, 
@jungle-prince's laughter and whoops throughout, wordless, no dialogue, no subtitles.

STYLE
8K photoreal, no game engine, no cutscene aesthetic. Naturalistic master cinematography, fine film grain, VFX-quality creature work.

POSITIVE LOCKS
Camera stays behind them the whole time. Colossal jungle scale held throughout. 
@phoenix-drake keeps the exact reference design every frame, no drift. 
@jungle-prince same person and wardrobe every frame. Eyes stay natural, no eye glow. Contact shadows read clearly. No music, no dialogue, no on-screen text, no watermark.
